From: Ayushman Chhabra <14110965+ayushmanchhabra@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 18:03:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix crash when picking a folder with nwdirectory

nwdirectory returns the picked folder without listing it, so base_dir
was never set, and FileChooserImpl's RemoveSymlinks() CHECKs it.

Refs: nwjs/nw.js#8393
---
 chrome/browser/file_select_helper.cc | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/file_select_helper.cc b/chrome/browser/file_select_helper.cc
index e670d4d3a..b30cac196 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/file_select_helper.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/file_select_helper.cc
@@ -200,6 +200,8 @@ void FileSelectHelper::FileSelected(const ui::SelectedFileInfo& file,
                         base::FilePath(file.display_name).AsUTF16Unsafe());
     return;
   }
+  if (dialog_mode_ == FileChooserParams::Mode::kUploadFolder)
+    base_dir_ = file.local_path;
 
   std::vector<ui::SelectedFileInfo> files;
   files.push_back(file);
-- 
